{"3844820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Million Dream", "steam_appid": 3844820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A sudden rain of money has fallen from the sky!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run through the city, collect as much cash as you can, and become a millionaire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/f4827ec22574a861f536f39ed9ad4fc5.poster.avif?t=1785068424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/f4827ec22574a861f536f39ed9ad4fc5.webm?t=1785068424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/f4827ec22574a861f536f39ed9ad4fc5.mp4?t=1785068424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Million Dream</i></strong> is a casual 3D action game where you race around collecting money falling from the sky in pursuit of unimaginable wealth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let police officers, townspeople, or even violent storms stand in your way. Dodge every obstacle and grab as much money as possible!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based slapstick action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique gimmicks in every stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple and intuitive controls</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3844820/extras/41b41f95736680ea6d61219148a5708c.poster.avif?t=1785068424\" width=1170 height=658 ><so